  "name": "FinFur Animus",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "FinFur Animus (FFA) is a furry convention in Finland, held at Hotel Gustavelund in Tuusula from 2015 to 2019 and at Hotel Tallukka in Vääksy since 2022. It continues the FinFur Summer Camp, which ended in 2014 after demand for a larger annual convention. It is organized by Roolipeliyhdistys FinFur Ry, an organization started by Slvwolf, Randon Wolf and Kisu in 2010 that hosts furry events in Finland. The first FinFur Animus was held March 19 to 22, 2015, with 124 attendees, and ticket sales have grown to 288 in 2026. Each edition has a playful theme, usually a pun on tails.",
